# Copy to .env.development and/or .env.production, or leave both out entirely.
#
# VITE_PROXY_URL points at the demo key Worker in ../proxy. When it is set, a
# visitor with no API key of their own borrows a shared, rate limited Gemini
# key, so the app works on first load. The key itself never reaches the browser.
#
# Leave it unset and the app is bring your own key. Generation, media
# understanding, captions and workflow capture all wait for a key entered in
# the header. Everything else works either way.
#
# This is a URL, not a credential. The secret lives in the Worker.
VITE_PROXY_URL=https://your-proxy.your-subdomain.workers.dev
